    20
@noindent
上方向にも右方向にも分岐することにより、バランスの取れたパターンを生成できます（@ref{Exercise 2.44}、@ref{Figure 2.13}、@ref{Figure 2.14}参照）:
    23
@lisp
(define (corner-split painter n)
  (if (= n 0)
      painter
      (let ((up (up-split painter (- n 1)))
            (right (right-split painter
                                (- n 1))))
        (let ((top-left (beside up up))
              (bottom-right (below right
                                   right))
              (corner (corner-split painter
                                    (- n 1))))
          (beside (below painter top-left)
                  (below bottom-right
                         corner))))))
@end lisp
    40
@float
@anchor{Figure 2.14}
@ifinfo
@quotation
