---->| * | *-+---->| * | *-+---->| * | * |
     +-|-+---+     +-|-+---+     +-|-+-|-+
       |             |             |   |
       V             V             V   V
 +---------+   +-------------+  +---+ +---+
 | complex |   | rectangular |  | 3 | | 4 |
 +---------+   +-------------+  +---+ +---+
@end example
@end quotation
@end ifinfo
