           | x: 3   |
           | y: 5   |
           +--------+
              ^  ^
              |  |
            C |  | D
+---------+   |  |   +----------+
|      II |   |  |   |      III |
| z: 6    +---+  +---+ m: 1     |
| x: 7    |          | y: 2     |
+---------+          +----------+
